(text "REV 0.1 - PROTOTYPE PCB SUBMITTED FOR FABRICATION" (at 20 18 0) (effects (font (size 2.0 2.0)) (justify left)) (uuid 409e639e-f7c3-4eb7-859d-e36a5f0d2efd))
(text "Connector symbols list physical pin numbers in one column. PCB view determines orientation." (at 20 26 0) (effects (font (size 1.1 1.1)) (justify left)) (uuid 2e2250e8-19d3-4d81-bfcf-ceaf490d83a6))
(text "FLOPPY: J4 pin n passes to J5 pin n. Documented ground positions also join GND." (at 20 159 0) (effects (font (size 1.2 1.2)) (justify left)) (uuid 9254895b-3170-48dd-b2e2-8e5013088f68))
(text "IDE ground pins 2/19/22/24/26/30/40 and floppy ground pins 1,5,7...33 share copper planes." (at 20 165 0) (effects (font (size 1.1 1.1)) (justify left)) (uuid 9f6e585b-150a-414c-870e-70ffb391fb7d))
(text "J2/J3 pin 38 = RESETn; J3 pin 37 = host pin 38. J3 pins 28 and 34 intentionally isolated." (at 20 171 0) (effects (font (size 1.1 1.1)) (justify left)) (uuid 8b3bd505-a511-419f-a7d5-3008f8246fc3))
(text "D1 / D2: cathodes (banded ends, pin 1) join host IRQ pin 31. Anodes go to each output IRQ." (at 20 227 0) (effects (font (size 1.1 1.1)) (justify left)) (uuid 6152cf3a-fb70-422e-8a99-fa918a3f5a8f))
(text "The two diodes isolate interrupt signals. Channel selection uses host pins 37 and 38." (at 20 235 0) (effects (font (size 1.1 1.1)) (justify left)) (uuid d4692ec6-7763-4b81-9600-32433d6f6334))
(text "No drive power supply, extra buffers or DMA support are added. Power drives separately." (at 20 243 0) (effects (font (size 1.1 1.1)) (justify left)) (uuid 72c4f5db-9434-4de2-8d33-ae5b1ebcce5b))
(text "Black PCB / white silkscreen. 58.42 x 55.88 mm. Four copper layers." (at 20 251 0) (effects (font (size 1.1 1.1)) (justify left)) (uuid 76087882-7d1e-4185-8282-a10bcab4ada4))
(text "UK Computing / JMC. Assembly, mechanical fit and Amiga hardware tests are pending." (at 20 259 0) (effects (font (size 1.1 1.1)) (justify left)) (uuid 7e779831-3b19-4a92-8ba4-b6664bac65da))
